1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,607
Orange...

2
00:00:00,607 --> 00:00:01,756
or this leaf?

3
00:00:01,756 --> 00:00:02,572
Which one has

4
00:00:02,572 --> 00:00:03,453
more vitamin C?

5
00:00:04,451 --> 00:00:06,135
The answer...

6
00:00:06,135 --> 00:00:07,365
THIS LEAF!

7
00:00:07,365 --> 00:00:07,851
Its vitamin C is

8
00:00:07,851 --> 00:00:09,690
3x an orange's!

9
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:11,083
Meet katuk leaves.

10
00:00:11,083 --> 00:00:12,875
Often ignored...

11
00:00:12,875 --> 00:00:13,476
yet they're

12
00:00:13,476 --> 00:00:14,468
packed with nutrients!

13
00:00:14,468 --> 00:00:15,220
But there's one thing

14
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,026
you must know...

15
00:00:17,026 --> 00:00:17,938
First:

16
00:00:17,938 --> 00:00:19,488
a nursing mom's best friend!

17
00:00:19,488 --> 00:00:20,906
Since grandma's time,

18
00:00:20,906 --> 00:00:21,710
katuk has been believed

19
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:23,223
to boost breast milk...

20
00:00:23,223 --> 00:00:24,798
and some studies say

21
00:00:24,798 --> 00:00:26,457
the results are promising!

22
00:00:26,457 --> 00:00:27,072
Second:

23
00:00:27,072 --> 00:00:29,927
its calcium beats...

24
00:00:29,927 --> 00:00:30,854
cow's milk!

25
00:00:30,854 --> 00:00:32,395
Yes, milk!

26
00:00:32,395 --> 00:00:33,405
Third:

27
00:00:33,405 --> 00:00:34,376
its carotenoids

28
00:00:34,376 --> 00:00:36,237
almost match carrots.

29
00:00:36,237 --> 00:00:37,032
Fourth:

30
00:00:37,032 --> 00:00:39,040
its iron equals spinach.

31
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,791
So if you're bored of spinach...

32
00:00:40,791 --> 00:00:41,876
here's your backup!

33
00:00:42,175 --> 00:00:43,696
here's what you must know.

34
00:00:43,696 --> 00:00:45,495
In 1990s Taiwan,

35
00:00:45,495 --> 00:00:46,312
a diet trend spread:

36
00:00:46,312 --> 00:00:47,628
raw katuk leaf juice.

37
00:00:47,628 --> 00:00:48,500
The result?

38
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,300
Many people got

39
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,310
serious lung problems!

40
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:52,757
So: cook it first,

41
00:00:52,757 --> 00:00:54,052
and don't overdo it.

42
00:00:54,052 --> 00:00:55,287
Cheap, easy to grow,

43
00:00:55,287 --> 00:00:56,415
full of benefits!

44
00:00:56,415 --> 00:00:57,507
Send this to a friend

45
00:00:57,507 --> 00:00:59,800
who still picks oranges!

